@startuml
title Weather Monitoring System State Diagram

[*] --> Register

state "Register" as Register
Register : entry / start state
Register : do / create an account
Register : exit / registration success or failure

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / user logs in with credentials
Login : do / login process
Login : exit / login successful or failure

state "Invalid Registration" as InvalidReg
InvalidReg : entry / registration not successful
InvalidReg : do / show error message
InvalidReg : exit / end state

state "Invalid Location" as InvalidLoc
InvalidLoc : entry / location entered is invalid
InvalidLoc : do / show error message
InvalidLoc : exit / end state

Login --> CheckWeather
Register --> Login

state "Check Weather" as CheckWeather
CheckWeather : entry / user selects a location to check weather
CheckWeather : do / validate location and fetch weather data
CheckWeather : exit / valid or invalid location

CheckWeather --> InvalidLoc : [invalid]
CheckWeather --> ChooseMetric : [valid]

state "Choose Metric" as ChooseMetric
ChooseMetric : entry / select what metric to check
ChooseMetric : do / user selects a metric
ChooseMetric : exit / selected metric shown

ChooseMetric --> ShowInfo : [temperature]
ChooseMetric --> ShowInfo : [humidity]
ChooseMetric --> ShowInfo : [rainfall]
ChooseMetric --> ShowInfo : [pressure]
ChooseMetric --> ShowInfo : [dew point]

state "Show Info" as ShowInfo
ShowInfo : entry / show selected weather information
ShowInfo : do / display the data
ShowInfo : exit / end state

CheckWeather --> ShowInfo : [valid]

state "View Additional Details" as ViewDetails
ViewDetails : entry / user selects additional details to view
ViewDetails : do / fetch and display additional details
ViewDetails : exit / end state

CheckWeather --> ViewDetails : [alerts]
CheckWeather --> ViewDetails : [weekly analysis]
CheckWeather --> ViewDetails : [future prediction]
CheckWeather --> ViewDetails : [graph]

state "Logout" as Logout
Logout : entry / user logs out
Logout : do / logout process
Logout : exit / end state

Login --> Logout
ShowInfo --> Logout
ViewDetails --> Logout
InvalidReg --> [*]
InvalidLoc --> [*]

@enduml
